<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The cross, it holdeth fast,</l><l>Hallelujah! hallelujah!</l><l>All things upon it cast,</l><l>Hallelujah! hallelujah!</l><l>Two arms extended strong</l><l>Hold those who there belong;</l><l>We’re through with self—our song:</l><l>Hallelujah for the cross!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>’Tis there man died in God,</l><l>Hallelujah! hallelujah!</l><l>There ceased this human clod,</l><l>Hallelujah! hallelujah!</l><l>With joy we all declare,</l><l>We’re terminated there!</l><l>We’ll sing now and fore’er,</l><l>Hallelujah for the cross!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
